;SYNTHETIC HETEROBIVALENT TACRINE-BASED DIMER, A8NH2 (N-9-(1', 2', 3', 4'-TETRAHYDROACRIDINYL)-1, 8-DIAMINOOCTANE) DIHYDROCHLORIDE WITH THE TACRINE MOIETY BOUND TO THE 'ANIONIC' SUBSITE, NEAR THE BOTTOM OF THE ACTIVE SITE GORGE, AND THE 8-AMINO MOIETY BOUND TO THE 'PERIPHERAL' ANIONIC SITE (PAS) AT THE TOP OF THE GORGE OF TCACHE. THE LIGAND, A8NH2, THUS BINDS BY SPANNING THE ACTIVE-SITE GORGE.
;
